    <section class="welcome-section">
        <h2><i class="fa-solid fa-compass section-icon"></i> Unit Overview</h2>
        <p>of Computer Science Unit Foundation Concepts The core concept is the Architecture of Execution. This unit focuses on the physical reality of the "Stored Program" concept (Von Neumann architecture). Key themes include the Hierarchy of Memory (balancing speed, cost, and capacity), the Orchestration of Instructions (the FDE Cycle), and the Abstraction of Infrastructure via Cloud services.</p>
    </section>

