                </li>
                <li>
                    <strong>A1.1.1</strong> — System Buses: Data, Address, and Control (Bidirectional vs Unidirectional).
                </li>
                <li>
                    <strong>A1.1.2</strong> — Role of the GPU: Parallel processing for graphics and non-graphics tasks (AI/simulations).
                </li>
                <li>
                    <strong>A1.1.4</strong> — Primary Memory: RAM (Volatility), ROM (Non-volatile, BIOS), and Cache hierarchy (L1, L2, L3).
                </li>
